{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike deckbuilder with a unique SPIN! As a guardian spirit, you use the magical wheel and cast spells to help human souls to overcome life's obstacles. Forge your custom wheel (deck) and unleash the ultimate combos to fulfill their destinies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882450/extras/20a69dd1249518202d9ebc7a2e5ce184.poster.avif?t=1756741092\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882450/extras/20a69dd1249518202d9ebc7a2e5ce184.webm?t=1756741092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882450/extras/20a69dd1249518202d9ebc7a2e5ce184.mp4?t=1756741092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Help, Not Kill</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of killing monsters? No worries, you will be helping poor human souls here, no killing required!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Where there is a Wheel, There is a Way</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the wheel to cast spells,\u00a0 boost the human's willpower (score) to help them overcome obstacles!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Spirited a Way</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon various helper spirits to build synergies and crazy combos!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882450?t=1756741092","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882450/b20d8be4a4062d504fb2b2c169d5be0a94486fbc/